WEBVTT

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.300
Do you hate tattoos?

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:57.810
Yes.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.290
I could never like something 
that took everything from me.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:07.000
But I can't escape tattoos now.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.130
I have no choice but to stay involved.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.970
I wish these things would just 
disappear from this world.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:52.020
Creator

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.190
As long as the nanomachines I created

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.740
hold off the erosion of your source,

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.570
BB, you can fight with all your strength.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.740
I must say goodbye.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.580
We will do what we must do.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.010
Izzy, stay back.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.140
Traitors must be punished.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.100
For the wages of sin is death!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.110
Blood!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.650
You get the brat!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.530
<i>Blood...</i>

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.620
Don't get full of yourself!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.640
He's lost so much blood...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.440
Hey... He's...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.110
Burns, the colonel is down! 
He needs immediate help!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.110
You take command for now!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.280
<i>Roger.</i>

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.240
<i>Why is BB here?</i>

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.370
This is Major Burns.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.000
I'm taking over command for 
Brigadier General Sanders.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.170
Kurz 23, give me a report.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.590
Kurz 23 here.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.670
Our unit is down to...

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.470
Eleven... No, ten!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.820
Retreat! Order all troops to retreat!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:02.820
Retreat?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.070
<i>Survivors, withdraw via our route!</i>

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.910
<i>Helicopters, relocate to point α-2!</i>

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.160
<i>Retrieve our men!</i>

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:12.160
<i>The living take priority, but gather 
as many of the dead as you can!</i>

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.120
<i>I'll take Seigi back.</i>

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.330
Major Burns!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.790
Tom-san!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.590
Tom, can you run? You can, right?

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.420
Take this girl and retreat!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.260
R-Roger!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.470
Let's go, Touko-chan.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.800
B-But Seigi is...

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.730
We can count on the lieutenant 
to handle Seigi-kun!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.560
Seigi...

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.740
You find it strange that you 
can't use Void Maker, yes?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.620
It's because my own Void Maker

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.040
is preventing your power from activating.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.040
What?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.080
There's no way you can—

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:04.090
You do not understand the original
objective of the triggerless tattoo.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.090
Its original objective?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.590
But I'm not going to tell you.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.930
You are no more than a key,

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.220
so you don't need to know.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.480
I thought you were more of a realist.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.400
I can't believe you're still avoiding 
physical contact with the void.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.410
"Let the enemy cut your flesh while 
you cut their bones," as they say.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.080
Not that you actually cut me.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.880
You haven't cut my bones, either.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.430
Seigi...

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.350
No! I have to be with Seigi!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.520
Touko-chan, not that way! It's dangero—

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.690
D-Damn... Of all the times for 
my tattoo to wear off...

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.730
My trigger...

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.110
Huh?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.690
God damn!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.870
What is that thing?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.780
I'll hold it off.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.950
Burns...

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.040
You take the opportunity to run.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.290
Don't be stupid, Leo.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.630
You won't last five minutes alone.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.090
When we die, we die together,

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.840
my soulmate.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.100
No matter how big you are, 
you're still just a cat!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.560
We're gonna cuddle you until 
you're meowing like one!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:47.730
Your absolute boundary reflects
all abilities, and all matter...

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.700
<i>But there's one thing it doesn't reflect.</i>

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.710
This is the second time 
I've cut your katana.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.550
I won't give you a chance to rest.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.840
If there's something I cannot 
have, I will destroy it myself.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.640
By killing and being killed,

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:22.100
let you and I be forever 
bound to one another!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.970
Gas to solid, solid to liquid...

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.770
Come on, let me hear you meow!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.690
Meow, meow!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.110
Did that get it?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.280
When did...

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.830
She can still use her

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.950
transmissive power, even in that form?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.460
Leo!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.470
What was that for?

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.140
I'm sorry...

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.430
But I at least want you to live, Lisa!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.600
Leo!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.700
Seigi, you promised, right?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.780
That we'd stay together...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.780
If you don't keep that promise,

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.490
I'll never forgive you!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.750
<i>I don't like the idea of 
killing a kid, but...</i>

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.210
Sorry!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.130
Humans cannot give up on fighting.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.810
They quarrel, they clash,

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.190
they hurt and kill each other.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:33.150
This has gone on throughout
history for thousands of years.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.650
What is this?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.950
Humans, with their high intelligence 
and social nature,

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.570
have wished to escape fighting,

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.990
but have never been successful at doing so.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.700
And that's because...

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.090
BB!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.170
Blood!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.840
I am Aegis Armadillo.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.140
You may not cross that boundary!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.480
Blood...

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:12.520
You bastard... I know you can hear me.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.270
Five minutes.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.440
At least lend me strength

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.650
in my final moments, damn it!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.750
Captain Ajita was no more 
than a human weapon.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.010
In truth, the strongest one in Brahman

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.510
was you, Cal.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.890
Civilization created by humans 
rejects natural selection,

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.310
hindering the species' evolution

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.730
and forcing it into a dead end.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:59.650
So long as humans are human, 
war will never go away.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.780
We will never move forward.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.160
As far as living things go, 
humans are a failure.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.240
What are you talking about?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.080
So I thought...

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.920
"Why don't I rebuild everything?"

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.920
Rebuild...

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:16.750
the human race?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.760
Y-You're...

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:24.590
<i>Rewriting the world as she sees fit...</i>

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.720
<i>The reason wasn't that simple at all.</i>

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.140
<i>She plans...</i>

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.810
<i>to use the power of tattoos 
to become a god!</i>

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.730
Hey, you! Are you okay with this?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.440
She intends to wipe out every 
human besides herself!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.240
Absurd. We of Brahman endorse the princess,

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.860
and have sworn our fealty to her.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.330
We have long since steeled our resolve.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.160
The way of the samurai is found in death!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:08.930
BB!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.940
<i>Blood...</i>

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:15.520
<i>Blood...</i>

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.400
<i>How can I be so powerless 
at a time like this?</i>

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.030
<i>Why did I even join the army?</i>

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.070
<i>What is my tattoo even for?</i>

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.570
Seigi! Break your bonds with Void Maker!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.740
You're the only one who can save Blood now!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.000
I know that.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.000
It's because of her that 
I can't use Void Maker.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:41.210
So if I had a power that 
could surpass that...

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.550
<i>You hear me, don't you, my source?</i>

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.300
<i>Give me strength...</i>

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:55.430
<i>The strength to surpass the princess!</i>

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:03.190
You really are a crazy little bastard...

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.150
Allow me to perform your last rites!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.960
Good job, Seigi!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.300
Th-This is...

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.860
He did it... BB won!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.120
Blood!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.620
Seigi, consume me!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.960
What are you saying?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.130
Weren't you and I gonna 
defeat the princess?!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.340
My role is now fulfilled.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.590
I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.180
You must be joking! You're incredible!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.890
You can get through anything, 
no matter how insane it is!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.390
It can't be over now...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:19.560
That doesn't m-make any sense!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.770
There's no more time! Do it!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.650
I know you can hear me, Seigi's source!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.190
This is...

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.450
my source?

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.950
Fool! You think I'm going 
to give it to you?!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:41.120
If the ruins must fall into the 
Kingdom's hands, just destroy them.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.880
Blow them to smithereens!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.960
You musclebound fool!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:16:00.390
Stop!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:07.480
Sorry for being...

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.610
selfish to the very end, Izzy.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.530
No... Wait!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.570
Wait, Blood!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.410
But I'm still going to keep my promise.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.170
And, Seigi...

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.760
You will become a true hero of justice.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:41.060
They intend to defy me?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.060
Mere antiques with the nerve to have 
senseless wills of their own...

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.230
Well, no matter. I have no 
further business here.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.530
I told you before, boy...

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.450
that I would give you despair and hatred.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.500
Seigi!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.010
Seigi!

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:57.010
<i>Touko...</i>

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.860
This is my prediction.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:15.240
You will make your way 
back to me soon enough,

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.660
carrying those two keys in your hand.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:22.120
Il, what sort of story do you 
think people desire the most?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.370
A revenge story?

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:26.080
Indeed.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:30.290
The pitiful hero loses his 
livelihood and his reason,

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:32.000
left with only burning hatred

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.630
as he races for vengeance...

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:38.050
Such stories will touch anyone's heart.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.860
Ah, how exciting...

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.980
I simply can't wait.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.620
The soul of a Sealed is his fuel.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.420
All tattoos link with the ruins, 
the origin of that fuel,

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.460
taking energy from the 
souls of their Sealed

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.260
and supplying it to the ruins 
in order to activate.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.720
And in return,

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.050
the Sealed can use its power.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.270
But each time a Sealed uses that power,

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.560
he is corroded by the tattoo,

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.020
until he's completely assimilated by it.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.610
In this last battle, 
Schrödinger's Cat was able to

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:22.610
make her source manifest 
without giving up her soul

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:25.070
because she had the princess's help.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:31.040
When a Sealed exhausts his soul,

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.330
either he's overtaken by the source

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.670
or he becomes an invalid.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.210
So BB wanted you to take him in

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.590
before that could

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.430
happen to him.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.300
Hello. We meet again.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.100
The guy who gave me the tattoo...

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.600
Seigi-kun, BB entrusted you with the future.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.690
But you've fallen into despair 
at your own powerlessness

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.440
and lost sight of the 
path you need to take.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.870
I was the one who pulled 
you into his world.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.540
Allow me to atone for that.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:10.240
That's right.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.330
You need to be punished.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.250
I was looking for Seigi,

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.420
but I never expected to find you here,

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.090
Professor Wiseman.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:22.380
Izzy...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.550
You are a strong woman, as always.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.550
Even after losing BB and your left arm.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:33.230
But you won't hand me over to the US Army,

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:35.770
because I have inherited BB's wish.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:40.020
I was the one who supported 
BB here in Japan.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.820
And now that he's gone,

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.240
I intend to make his wish 
my own and act on it.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.490
So would the two of you

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:50.240
have faith and follow me?

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:52.950
What was Blood's wish?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.120
The destruction of all tattoos on Earth.

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:06.300
I'll erase them.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:12.470
Humans did not gain such high 
intelligence and free will

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.390
solely through the evolution 
of the cerebrum,

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:18.560
but through the higher-order structure 
gained in the evolutionary process—

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:22.070
in other words, the reciprocal 
function of the soul and brain.

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.230
And tattoos were made

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.280
through the processing of that soul.

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.740
So it wouldn't be unheard of for a 
tattoo to take on a will of its own.

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:32.160
You're saying...

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:34.450
Yes. That's what the source is.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:42.540
BB was overtaken by his source
because he overused his power.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:45.920
That means it'll happen to me, too.

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:48.340
Well, I guess that's fine.

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:50.680
An ending like that would suit me.

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:52.640
Seigi-kun.

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:56.890
What you need now is to 
mature psychologically.

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.100
What the hell?!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.940
Are you saying Touko and BB will come 
back to life if I just grow up?!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:06.610
And tattoos will disappear, 
and Izzy will get her left arm back?!

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:10.700
I believe you learned during that battle

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.280
how powerless, foolish,

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:14.870
and young you are.

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:19.790
But the path you must 
take lies beyond that.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.260
A fragment of BB's soul remains inside you.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.840
I'm going to use this machine

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:31.010
to show you BB's memories.

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:34.100
BB's memories?

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:36.390
It is the past,

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.480
as well as your future.

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:45.020
BB, you should join Brahman as of today.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:47.280
If you betray me,

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.030
I will take back the triggerless tattoo

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.780
in exchange for your death.

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.080
The Past
